'''Body & Soul''' (心と体、繋ぐもの ''Kokoro to Karada, Tsunagu Mono'', '''That Which Connects the Mind and Body''') is the 27th sub-chapter of [[Stories of Legend]]. It was added in [[Version 4.7 Update|Version 4.7]] and is available up to {{4c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
This subchapter features a lot of heavy enemy-spam. Half of the stages are easy enough, but the others can be extremely difficult, especially if you're underleveled. Those stages require certain cats, a specific strategy to overcome these challenges, and determination. You are also expected to have all [[Anti-unstarred Alien Treasures]] and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]]'s [[True Form]], as without them it will be nearly impossible to beat [[Cursed Blizzards]] and [[Sign of the Cat]].

As you may know, this sub-chapter has the infamous [[Gestalt, Decay]], whose [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] enemy spam has overwhelmed countless unprepared players with absurd DPS, necessitating the usage of multiple spammable attackers and possibly a lure-based strategy. The second hardest stage is probably [[Metabolic Syndrome]], which forces the player to fight 3 Alien bosses without much cash to work with.
{{LegendDiff|120|140|100}}

==New Features==
This sub-chapter introduces one new enemy:
*[[Mr. Mole]]: An uber-[[Long Distance]] attacker with a great deal of health and the [[Special Abilities|ability]] to [[Knockback|knockback]] cats.
*[[Into the Future]] Chapter 3's [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] enemies (except for [[Raging Bahamut Cat]]) are also introduced to [[Legend Stages]] in this sub-chapter.

